          "fill": "#C8D0E0",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A global search that can find any permitted conversation, message, document, event note, member profile, speaker thread, or task. Group results by type and make it permission-aware: execs can search organization-wide; members and speakers only see content connected to them.",
